🔴 api in shop was killed for using more memory than its 256Mi limit. Confirmed.
---
- Last exit: OOMKilled, exit code 137, 4 restarts in 40 minutes.
- The limit is 256Mi and the request is 128Mi.

Raise the memory limit to 384Mi, half again above the observed peak of 255Mi (changes the cluster):
```
kubectl set resources deployment/payments -n shop -c app --limits=memory=384Mi
```
